;\">\r\n<p>Farmers often make decisions in real time, under pressure and with narrow windows to protect yield.</p>\r\n<p><strong>The solution:</strong> PepsiCo says AI tools are helping growers spot pest and disease pressure earlier, while also reducing chemical use.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47304098.444010/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL3Nwb25zb3JlZC9wdXR0aW5nLWZhcm1lcnMtZmlyc3Qtd2l0aC1haT9heGlvc19hZGxpbms9MSZ1dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aCb7a8b5d0\" target=\"_blank\">Read the Q&amp;A.</a></p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  2. 🌄 Parting shot: Alpine glow </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><div align=\"center\"><!--[if mso]><img alt='' src='https://images.axios.com/2ZZ1IFX3ZJ3q7uY5k4Vol3PFifE=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/08/31/1788202421188.jpeg' style='display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;' width='558' /><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.axios.com/2ZZ1IFX3ZJ3q7uY5k4Vol3PFifE=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/08/31/1788202421188.jpeg\" style=\"display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;\" width=\"100%\"/><!--<![endif]--></div> <div class=\"bodytext\" style=\"font-size:13px; font-family:'Gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#848484; margin-bottom:20px;\">Photo: Ashley Mahoney</div><p><strong>A sunrise 